 in turn:\n\n- For the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4y+2 & =-4y-5 \\\\ -4y+2+4y & =-4y-5+4y \\\\ 2 & =-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $y.$ Therefore, the equation $-4y+2=-4y-5$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6y+3 & =6y-1 \\\\ 6y+3-6y & =6y-1-6y \\\\ 3 & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $y.$ Therefore, the equation $6y+3=6y-1$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5y-7 & =2y+1 \\\\ 5y-7-2y+7 & =2y+1-2y+7 \\\\ 3y & =8 \\\\ y & =\\frac{8}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $5y-7=2y+1$ has the unique solution $y=\\frac{8}{3}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"" 13194139533812 true] [17592186252929 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252930 13194139533812 true] [17592186252929 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252931 13194139533812 true] [17592186252929 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252932 13194139533812 true] [17592186252929 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252933 13194139533812 true] [17592186252929 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252934 13194139533812 true] [17592186252929 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533812 true] [17592186252929 1041 "selection" 13194139533812 true] [17592186252929 1104 #edb/ref 17592186252934 13194139533812 true] [17592186252929 1110 #uuid "c12deb50-4da8-53eb-9edf-73092abbf67c" 13194139533812 true] [17592186252930 1034 "I, II, and III" 13194139533812 true] [17592186252930 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533812 true] [17592186252930 1111 #uuid "c708be9e-ad93-519a-a3ec-fe6426e02b11" 13194139533812 true] [17592186252931 1034 "II and III only" 13194139533812 true] [17592186252931 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533812 true] [17592186252931 1111 #uuid "6621e02e-818e-5ffd-aad1-abbc6bdb2482" 13194139533812 true] [17592186252932 1034 "I and III only" 13194139533812 true] [17592186252932 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533812 true] [17592186252932 1111 #uuid "dddd2ac9-fd00-5018-91f7-